WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.932
This example updates city through a simple
active-patient view RETURNING

00:00:05.959 --> 00:00:11.950
shows the changed row The transaction then rolls
back so the demonstration

00:00:11.977 --> 00:00:17.555
does not permanently modify the teaching database
This is a good pattern

00:00:17.568 --> 00:00:19.686
when learning or testing write behavior
